40:15.139 --> 40:24.823
[SPEAKER_01]: tabletop. So, so very, very exciting. Yeah, very, very interesting. And, you know, a lot, lots of options to top land, you know, most of the

40:24.863 --> 40:37.473
[SPEAKER_01]: rivers running, you know, in the middle, obviously trigger off, you know, thermals that are flowing from the flats. So, yeah. Amazing. I

40:37.493 --> 40:44.695
