43:07.170 --> 43:14.478
[SPEAKER_00]: Makes sense. You know, how's the local friendliness? Because as I understand, this is agricultural land and everyone kind of makes a

43:14.538 --> 43:23.547
[SPEAKER_00]: living out of these places, the farmers over there. Unlike big European or first world economies, they kind of literally survive over this. So

43:23.787 --> 43:32.574
[SPEAKER_00]: how is the local friendliness when you come in with your wing and if you happen to kind of... I mean, I've never met a single aggressive local in

